    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SUMMER: You want something nice on the sand that’s about 5-10k a month...\nSTEPHANIE: OK, now take off your shirt.",
      "STEPHANIE: Baywatch isn’t just a job. It’s a calling. So if you aren’t here for the right reasons... ...you might as well leave now. CJ?\nCJ: There are a maximum of three spots available for the summer season. So, big bummer, the rest of you will have to wait til next year.",
      "STEPHANIE: Hold your position, we’re on our way! Over.\nVICTORIA: Uhh... OK. I won’t be able to see you coming, but I’ll be here, waving my arms... Over.",
      "BRAXTON LEEDS: How are you liking the party, CJ?\nCJ: Fantastic. How about you give me the grand tour? And do you have a gift shop? My friend Stephanie needs a new suit --\nBRAXTON LEEDS: Of course! Right this way --",
      "CJ: See, Stephanie -- I’d told you you’d look amazing in one of my dresses!\nSTEPHANIE: When would you even wear something like this?!\nCJ: Sunday Brunch."
    ]
  },
